st people gloss over. <br>\nTime has real and imaginary dimensions like electricity.</p>\n<p>There&#x27;s an echo before the transmission in imaginary space.</p>\n<p>You can even build imaginary antenna resonators. Take a loop and cut off the far half. It changes the impedance by materializing am imaginary resistive resonator load called j. 32 + 18j ohms is 50 ohms equivalent.</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpxuGeXMAAZ5AO.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2106120815624208543\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2106120815624208543</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2105763779808231900\">https://x.com/i/status/2105763779808231900</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Shaun_Fosmark/status/2105763779808231900\">https://x.com/Shaun_Fosmark/status/2105763779808231900</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2106120815624208543</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2106120815624208543\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-10-02T20:35:06.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2106120815624208543</dd>\n</dl>"},"2106123957229486268":{"a":"<p>Electrostatic Grid <br>\nhundreds of millions to billions to trillions of electron volts</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q1V6BX-Cdds\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/q1V6BX-Cdds?enablejsapi=1\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; pic